{"seq":3,"slug":"direct-air-capture","title":"直接空气捕集 DAC","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/ccus/capture/direct-air-capture","wordCount":1338,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"直接空气捕集-dac\">直接空气捕集 DAC</h1><p>前面三篇捕集技术都有一个共同前提：有一根烟囱，里面是浓度可观的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。直接空气捕集（DAC，Direct Air Capture）则把整个大气当作「烟囱」，从约 420 ppm（0.042%）的稀薄空气里把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 抓下来。这是 CCUS 里浓度最低、能耗最高、成本最贵的一条路，却也是唯一能抵消分散排放、移除历史存量碳的工程化负排放手段——它不和工业捕集争食，而是去填那些有烟囱的技术永远够不着的空白。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>DAC 的核心矛盾是「用极少的能量从极稀的空气里富集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>」。要让海量空气流过捕集介质，再把吸附的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 释放出来。按捕集介质和再生方式，工业界分成两大技术流派：高温液体吸收（液态 DAC，L-DAC）和低温固体吸附（固态 DAC，S-DAC）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[大气 420ppm CO2] --&gt; B[风机抽入空气]&#10;  B --&gt; C{捕集介质}&#10;  C --&gt;|液态 L-DAC| D[KOH 碱液吸收&lt;br/&gt;生成碳酸盐]&#10;  C --&gt;|固态 S-DAC| E[胺基固体吸附]&#10;  D --&gt; F[高温煅烧 约900度&lt;br/&gt;释放CO2]&#10;  E --&gt; G[中低温+真空 约100度&lt;br/&gt;释放CO2]&#10;  F --&gt; H[纯CO2压缩]&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I[永久地质封存&lt;br/&gt;实现负排放]\">flowchart TD\n  A[大气 420ppm CO2] --&gt; B[风机抽入空气]\n  B --&gt; C{捕集介质}\n  C --&gt;|液态 L-DAC| D[KOH 碱液吸收&lt;br/&gt;生成碳酸盐]\n  C --&gt;|固态 S-DAC| E[胺基固体吸附]\n  D --&gt; F[高温煅烧 约900度&lt;br/&gt;释放CO2]\n  E --&gt; G[中低温+真空 约100度&lt;br/&gt;释放CO2]\n  F --&gt; H[纯CO2压缩]\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I[永久地质封存&lt;br/&gt;实现负排放]</pre><p>下表对比两大流派，它们的能源需求与选址逻辑差异显著：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>液态 DAC（L-DAC）</th>\n<th>固态 DAC（S-DAC）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>捕集介质</td>\n<td>强碱液（KOH/NaOH）</td>\n<td>胺改性固体吸附剂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>再生温度</td>\n<td>约 900°C（高温煅烧）</td>\n<td>约 80–120°C（中低温+真空）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>能源形式</td>\n<td>高温热（可烧气/电）</td>\n<td>低温热+电（可用余热/地热）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代表项目</td>\n<td>1PointFive Stratos</td>\n<td>Climeworks Mammoth</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模块化</td>\n<td>大型集中式</td>\n<td>模块化可堆叠</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"液态-dac-用强碱-吃-二氧化碳\">液态 DAC：用强碱「吃」二氧化碳</h2><p>液态路线让空气穿过喷淋的氢氧化钾溶液，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是酸性气体，被碱液捕获生成碳酸钾：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>KOH</mtext><mo>→</mo><msub><mtext>K</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext>O</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2 + 2\\,\\text{KOH} \\rightarrow \\text{K}_2\\text{CO}_3 + \\text{H}_2\\text{O}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">KOH</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">K</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>随后通过一系列化学循环把碳转移到碳酸钙固体上，再在约 900°C 的煅烧炉里把碳酸钙分解、放出纯 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，氧化钙循环利用。这条路线的特点是再生温度极高，需要稳定的高温热源，因此倾向建成大型集中式设施。1PointFive 的 Stratos 工厂（美国得州）是这条路线的旗舰，设计年捕集能力高达 50 万吨 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，2025 年 4 月还拿到了首个针对 DAC 封存的 EPA Class VI 注入许可（来源：1PointFive / EPA）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"固态-dac-低温吸附的模块化打法\">固态 DAC：低温吸附的模块化打法</h2><p>固态路线把胺基官能团固定在多孔材料上，常温下空气流过时吸附 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，吸饱后关闭风机、抽真空并加热到约 80–120°C，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 就被释放出来收集，吸附剂随即进入下一轮循环——这是一个「温度-真空摆动吸附」（TVSA）过程。它最大的优势是再生温度低，可以利用地热、工业余热等廉价低品位热源，而且单元小、可像积木一样堆叠扩容。Climeworks 在冰岛的 Mammoth 工厂是这条路线的代表，设计年捕集能力约 3.6 万吨 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，配合当地玄武岩矿化封存（碳被矿化成石头，永久性极高，机理见<a href=\"../transport-storage/geological-storage\">地质封存</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"能耗与成本-为什么这么贵\">能耗与成本：为什么这么贵</h2><p>DAC 昂贵的根源在<a href=\"../foundations/sources-pathways\">碳源与减排路径</a>已点明——大气 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 分压只有约 40 Pa，比工业烟道低三个数量级，理论最小分离功因此高得多。叠加风机推动海量空气、再生加热等实际损耗，当前 DAC 全成本约 400–1000 美元/吨：其中 Stratos 约 400–500 美元/吨，微软与 1PointFive 的多年期合约价被报道在 200–300 美元/吨，Climeworks 的碳信用售价约 600–800 美元/吨（来源：各公司公开披露与碳市场报道，2025–2026）。这条成本曲线正沿着<a href=\"../foundations/maturity-cost\">技术成熟度与成本</a>讲的学习曲线快速下探，Climeworks 把 2030 年目标定在 250–350 美元/吨，DOE 的终极门槛是 100 美元/吨以下。</p>\n<h2 id=\"选址哲学-跟着便宜的清洁能源走\">选址哲学：跟着便宜的清洁能源走</h2><p>DAC 有一个其他捕集技术没有的自由度——它不依附于任何排放源，可以建在任何地方。理性的选址会同时满足三个条件：便宜且清洁的能源（否则捕集本身的排放会抵消成果，甚至倒贴）、就近的封存地质条件、合适的政策与碳信用市场。冰岛（地热+玄武岩）、美国墨西哥湾沿岸（廉价能源+成熟盐穴地质）正是这套逻辑的产物。也正因 DAC 与清洁电力深度绑定，它的扩张节奏受制于<a href=\"../../clean-energy/\">清洁能源</a>与<a href=\"../../power-grid-and-energy-storage/\">电网与储能</a>的供给。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[DAC 选址] --&gt; B[便宜清洁能源]&#10;  A --&gt; C[就近封存地质]&#10;  A --&gt; D[政策与碳信用市场]&#10;  B --&gt; E[冰岛 地热]&#10;  B --&gt; F[墨西哥湾 廉价电]&#10;  C --&gt; G[玄武岩矿化 / 盐穴]&#10;  D --&gt; H[CDR 自愿市场 + 45Q DAC 抵免]\">graph TD\n  A[DAC 选址] --&gt; B[便宜清洁能源]\n  A --&gt; C[就近封存地质]\n  A --&gt; D[政策与碳信用市场]\n  B --&gt; E[冰岛 地热]\n  B --&gt; F[墨西哥湾 廉价电]\n  C --&gt; G[玄武岩矿化 / 盐穴]\n  D --&gt; H[CDR 自愿市场 + 45Q DAC 抵免]</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>DAC 从约 420 ppm 的稀薄大气捕集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，是浓度最低、成本最高、却唯一能抵消分散排放与移除存量碳的工程化负排放手段。</li>\n<li>两大流派：液态 DAC（强碱吸收+约 900°C 煅烧，集中式，代表 Stratos 50 万吨/年）与固态 DAC（胺基吸附+约 100°C 温真空摆动，模块化，代表 Mammoth 3.6 万吨/年）。</li>\n<li>当前成本约 400–1000 美元/吨，正沿学习曲线下探，2030 年目标 250–350 美元/吨、长期 &lt;100 美元/吨。</li>\n<li>DAC 不依附排放源，选址跟着「便宜清洁能源+就近封存+碳市场」走，故与清洁电力扩张深度绑定。</li>\n<li>只有当捕集的碳进入永久封存时才算真正负排放，否则不过是搬运。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"直接空气捕集 DAC","id":"直接空气捕集-dac"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"液态 DAC：用强碱「吃」二氧化碳","id":"液态-dac-用强碱-吃-二氧化碳"},{"level":2,"text":"固态 DAC：低温吸附的模块化打法","id":"固态-dac-低温吸附的模块化打法"},{"level":2,"text":"能耗与成本：为什么这么贵","id":"能耗与成本-为什么这么贵"},{"level":2,"text":"选址哲学：跟着便宜的清洁能源走","id":"选址哲学-跟着便宜的清洁能源走"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"燃烧前与富氧燃烧","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/ccus/capture/pre-oxy-combustion"},"next":{"title":"CO2 运输","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/ccus/transport-storage/co2-transport"}}